{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"元年春王正月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"齊師、宋師、曹伯次于聶北，救邢。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"夏六月，邢遷于夷儀。齊師、宋師、曹師城邢。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"秋七月戊辰，夫人姜氏薨于夷，齊人以歸。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"楚人伐鄭。八月，公會齊侯、宋公、鄭伯、曹伯、邾人于檉。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"九月，公敗邾師于偃。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"冬十月壬午，公子友帥師敗莒于酈。獲莒拏。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"十有二月丁巳，夫人氏之喪至自齊。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"元年春，不稱即位，公出故也。公出復入，不書，諱之也。諱國惡，禮也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"諸侯救邢。邢人潰，出奔師。師遂逐狄人，具邢器用而遷之，師無私焉。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"夏，邢遷于夷儀，諸侯城之，救患也。凡侯伯，救患、分災、討罪，禮也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"秋，楚人伐鄭，鄭即齊故也。盟於犖，謀救鄭也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"九月，公敗邾師于偃，虛丘之戍將歸者也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"冬，莒人來求賂。公子友敗諸酈，獲莒子之弟拏。非卿也，嘉獲之也。公賜季友汶陽之田及費。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_64_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_64","textTraditional":"夫人氏之喪至自齊。君子以齊人殺哀姜也為已甚矣！女子，從人者也。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}